# Events & Specials

This weekend will be jam packed with a full day of fun at The Apsara Festival, Maleny.  Rhythm Culture will be having a stall and a community drumming jam.  Information on upcoming classes and events in the New Year will be available and to celebrate xmas and the end of a fantastic year there will be an awesome 20% of all drum purchases and 10 week courses booked for 2013. So gather your xmas pennies and buy your friends, family and yourself a special treat for the New Year! [The Apsara Music Festival](http://www.apsaramusicfestival.com/) [![Rhythm Culture Drums for Sale](/media/2012/11/DSC00684.jpg "DSC00684")](/media/2012/11/DSC00684.jpg) Get 20% off this weekend @ Apsara Festival, Maleny.
